<h1 nodeId="5577993f905e4f93be85065709c52dfb"><span color="#f5232d">规则熔断现已支持在zeus页面配置，具体见规则熔断新文档 </span><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1091686902" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1091686902" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="11c1c7c3555f4b6d9c7586e0f2bee501">https://km.sankuai.com/page/1091686902</a></h1>
<h1 nodeId="37dce85106d94eebaead54dbef4a3b4a">一、解决问题</h1>
<p nodeId="68921ce1c39c48e7ba733ddf866bec43">熔断，规则引擎的安全功能之一，主要解决因各种原因导致的 <span color="rgb(255, 0, 0)"><strong>生效</strong></span><strong> </strong>规则 <span color="rgb(255, 0, 0)">命中Zeus请求量（含拦截、限制支付方式等对业务有干预的决策） </span>突增，避免对业务造成大规模误伤，命中量突增原因包括以下：</p>
<ul nodeId="bf97af243fb442d8b7fb62163fd177a7">
<li nodeId="0a4d872e9838414b88661e2f058eb163">风控修改规则配置</li>
<li nodeId="08c0358ed5254d5192ee9621edc3ff62">业务参数名称或值发生变更</li>
<li nodeId="0694cf74a0614443b8e0b81aa7da24ad">接口或依赖组件错误</li>
<li nodeId="99864b7a9e854a1b91b9f353baf1fc88">其他未知因素导致的命中量突变</li>
</ul>
