<h4 nodeId="4ba31b1028aa47e58566d008bff9c034"><span font-size="14">2.1.1.1 找到所需业务的BusinessKey</span></h4>
<p nodeId="b6b6c7e160274ace9dc39d0574b5fbaa"><span font-size="14">1）首先进入CAT首页：</span><a href="http://cat.sankuai.com/cat/s/business?op=list" title="http://cat.sankuai.com/cat/s/business?op=list" nodeId="9db2f89b68894d3bb24b33a5656623bd"><span font-size="14">http://cat.sankuai.com/cat/s/business?op=list</span></a></p>
<p nodeId="dbaf8e2752e2436f902b535faf9c6480"><span font-size="14">2）Domain输入框中输入：com.sankuai.rc.zeus.worker</span></p>
<p nodeId="ed8c26cecc9b4659a84495d79b7ce6d2"><span font-size="14">3）选择报表展示-业务告警配置</span></p>
<p nodeId="748c335ea8ee43ab80744b26478d4f53"><span font-size="14">4）BusinessKey是关键部分，命名规范如下</span></p>
<ul nodeId="23ac7af54c4f4b5d955b4ee6bf49b575">
<li nodeId="07be6cd5fec640269e29c1533c4b4174"><span font-size="14">scene代表场景，rule代表规则，decision代表决策，第一个数字代表业务id，第二个数字代表决策id</span></li>
<li nodeId="2557cf949d8b4c15b262a209078677d6"><span font-size="14">例如：scene_and_rule_1_2表示 业务为1（反作弊）、决策为2（拦截）的生效规则在某个场景下的命中监控；rule_decison_1</span></li>
</ul>
<p nodeId="b8b11f72826747f5881c8bab08cff946"><span color="rgb(240, 94, 80)"><span font-size="14">Tips:如何找到自己业务id、决策id呢？</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="5e4521bdb05b4482b80e350be0291973"><span font-size="14">业务ID：</span><a href="https://zeus.sankuai.com/business_group_mappings/get_list" title="https://zeus.sankuai.com/business_group_mappings/get_list" nodeId="b65c74e225bb43658cd64c6c45ccf353"><span font-size="14">https://zeus.sankuai.com/business_group_mappings/get_list</span></a></p>
<p nodeId="7f3d3c0a7ca242d0b436678d5936528a"><a href="https://zeus.sankuai.com/business_group_mappings/get_list" nodeId="ad23299ceda840b9a1984d132c16bda3"></a><span font-size="14">决策ID：</span><a href="https://zeus.sankuai.com/decision/search" title="https://zeus.sankuai.com/decision/search" nodeId="4c1c63bcc23246b6a6d4750b63f285df"><span font-size="14">https://zeus.sankuai.com/decision/search</span></a></p>
</td>
