<h4 nodeId="e0720afd06a34d829aa8206170a51bc1"><span font-size="14">2.1.1.2 添加告警逻辑</span></h4>
<p nodeId="4c578e5f3967407392155a99ccc5947b"><span font-size="14">1）业务告警配置-右侧告警编辑-新增告警</span></p>
<p nodeId="a964815d65be43d681176ddb69e4801b"><span font-size="14">2）告警名：</span><span color="rgb(57, 57, 57)"><span font-size="14">warning_开头表示这是一条告警逻辑，只报出不熔断；</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="f311b7945047456682b3b160d47db39d"><span color="rgb(57, 57, 57)"><span font-size="14">3）告警对象：次数</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="6c2b5988bbf74dc6a1d12df3826322b7"><span color="rgb(57, 57, 57)"><span font-size="14">4）告警级别：P0、P1、P2……</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="f967a0419ca94991b1c3e895c943673c"><span color="rgb(57, 57, 57)"><span font-size="14">5）告警组：大家可以自己配置，向告警组中添加mis号</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="9d84f850bf334b26a3b1ea59426d9ab6"><span color="rgb(57, 57, 57)"><span font-size="14">6）告警方式：大象、邮件、短信、语音可以组合使用</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="1f887229bbda4215bd2a67fcb7020509"><span color="rgb(57, 57, 57)"><span font-size="14">7）夜间模式、降级链接：高端功能，可默认不填</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="40357ad15201483ab802dde976341a28"><span color="rgb(57, 57, 57)"><span font-size="14">8）剩下的监控可参考链接：</span></span><a href="http://docs.sankuai.com/doc/arch_dp/cat/alarm/alarm/" title="http://docs.sankuai.com/doc/arch_dp/cat/alarm/alarm/" nodeId="b371cf93f4a646c48c749e71c4e2cffe"><span font-size="14">http://docs.sankuai.com/doc/arch_dp/cat/alarm/alarm/</span></a></p>
